# Used with: scripts/e2e.sh tests/e2e/links.actions -- target/debug/temzdf target/fixtures/sample.pdf
# Coordinates assume the default 900x600 window (fit width, page 1 at the top).
# Expected: clicking "3 Filler" in the table of contents jumps to section 3 on
# page 2 (clicked.png); Backspace (or Ctrl-o) returns to the table of contents (back.png);
# Alt+Right goes forward again (forward.png).
pause 1
click 160 412
pause 1
shot clicked
keys BackSpace
pause 1
shot back
keys alt+Right
pause 1
shot forward
